          "sections": [
            {
              "key": "condition",
              "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"a6e5f963-52f8-4755-b2dc-09073a0c9889\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/a6e5f963-52f8-4755-b2dc-09073a0c9889\"/>В тре­уголь­ни­ке <var data-math-identifier=\"ABC\">ABC</var> <var data-math-identifier=\"AC\">AC</var>  =  <var data-math-identifier=\"BC\">BC</var>, угол <var data-math-identifier=\"C\">C</var> равен 120°,  <span data-inline-latex=\"AB=2\\sqrt{3}\"></span> . Най­ди­те <var data-math-identifier=\"AC\">AC</var>.</p>",
              "title": "Условие",
              "asset_keys": [
                "image_1"
              ],
              "section_id": "condition:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
            },
            {
              "key": "answer",
              "html": "<p><span data-effect=\"spaced\">2</span></p>",
              "title": "Ответ",
              "asset_keys": [],
              "section_id": "answer:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "key": "solution",
              "html": "<section data-content-kind=\"solution\" data-solution-title=\"Решение\"><p>Вос­поль­зу­ем­ся тео­ре­мой ко­си­ну­сов:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"AB^{2}=AC^{2}+BC^{2}-2AC\\cdot BC\\cdot \\cos \\angle C=2AC^{2}\\cdot (1-\\cos \\angle C)\"></span> .</p></center><p> Тогда </p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"AC=\\sqrt{\\frac{AB^{2}}{2\\cdot (1-\\cos \\angle C)}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{12}{2\\cdot (1+0{,}5)}}=2\"></span>. </p></center></section><section data-content-kind=\"solution\" data-solution-title=\"Приведем другое решение\"><p>Углы при ос­но­ва­нии дан­но­го рав­но­бед­рен­но­го тре­уголь­ни­ка равны 30°. При­ме­ним тео­ре­му си­ну­сов: </p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{AC}{\\sin 30^{\\circ}}=\\frac{AB}{\\sin 120^{\\circ}}\\iff AC=AB\\cdot \\frac{\\sin 30^{\\circ}}{\\sin 120^{\\circ}}\\iff AC=2\\sqrt{3}\\cdot \\frac{\\frac{1}{2}}{\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}}\\iff AC=2\"></span>. </p></center></section>",
              "title": "Решение",
              "asset_keys": [],
              "section_id": "solution:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
            }
          ],
          "schema_version": 3,
          "problem_reference_ids": {
