              "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"a6e5f963-52f8-4755-b2dc-09073a0c9889\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/a6e5f963-52f8-4755-b2dc-09073a0c9889\"/>В тре­уголь­ни­ке <var data-math-identifier=\"ABC\">ABC</var> <span data-inline-latex=\"AC=BC\"></span>, угол <var data-math-identifier=\"C\">C</var> равен <span data-inline-latex=\"120^{\\circ}\"></span>, <span data-inline-latex=\"AC=4\\sqrt{3}\"></span> . Най­ди­те <var data-math-identifier=\"AB\">AB</var>.</p>",
              "title": "Условие",
              "asset_keys": [
                "image_1"
              ],
              "section_id": "condition:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
            },
            {
              "key": "solution",
              "html": "<p>Найдём косинус данного угла:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"\\cos \\angle C=\\cos 120^{\\circ}=- \\frac{1}{2}\"></span>.</p></center><p>По теореме косинусов:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"AB^{2}=AC^{2}+BC^{2}-2AC\\cdot BC\\cos \\angle C\"></span>.</p></center><p>Так как <span data-inline-latex=\"AC=BC=4\\sqrt{3}\"></span>, подставим известные значения и последовательно выполним вычисления:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"AB^{2}=(4\\sqrt{3})^{2}+(4\\sqrt{3})^{2}-2\\cdot(4\\sqrt{3})\\cdot(4\\sqrt{3})\\cdot(- \\frac{1}{2})\\iff AB^{2}=48+48-2\\cdot 48\\cdot(- \\frac{1}{2})\\iff AB^{2}=48+48+48\\iff AB^{2}=144\"></span>.</p></center><p>Длина стороны положительна, поэтому</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"AB=\\sqrt{144}=12\"></span>.</p></center>",
              "title": "Решение",
              "asset_keys": [],
              "section_id": "solution:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
            },
            {
              "key": "answer",
              "html": "<p><span data-effect=\"spaced\">12</span></p>",
              "title": "Ответ",
              "asset_keys": [],
              "section_id": "answer:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            }
